    println("table with load factor 1 − ε (ε = 3/4): 4096 buckets × 8 slots, and each")
    println("key's bucket is IMPLICIT — a pure two-choice hash of the key. The stash")
    println("entry stores only the intra-bucket address: 1 choice bit + 3 slot bits =")
    println("a 4-bit tiny pointer = Θ(log ε⁻¹) — never log₂((1+ε)m) = 15 bits, the")
    println("naive full-address stash. The 4 pointer bits never grow with the array.")
