    println("hash quotient (the bin index IS the quotient — stored nowhere), and each")
    println("entry's fingerprint grows only enough to separate bin-mates (adaptivity")
    println("bits, O(m) total). Query(k) finds its entry in O(1) expected RAM steps")
    println("and reads external memory exactly once; inserts/deletes are O(1) expected;")
    println("positions are permanent (page-table stability, the paper's motivating use).")
